                <p>
                    <lb n="1"/><hi rend="grantha">svastiśrī <supplied reason="undefined"><g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g></supplied> tribhu</hi>va<unclear>ṉacca</unclear><hi rend="grantha"><unclear>kra</unclear></hi>vattikaḷ maturaikoṇṭu pāṇṭiya<unclear>ṉ</unclear> muṭiyaṉai muṭittalaiyuṅ koṇṭaruḷiya <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi> kulottuṅkacoḻatevaṟku yāṇṭu patiṉeḻāvatu ṉāḷ Iruṉūṟ <gap reason="lost" quantity="6" unit="character"/> 
